        },
        {
            "+content": "In this world, on the day they reach adulthood, everyone visits the temple to receive their life's calling. Many will become warriors or magic users. But when Arsrod, the frail younger brother of a minor feudal lord, goes in for his career, he comes out with Oda Nobunaga. Not only has no one ever heard of the job, but not a single person can figure out what it's even supposed to mean. When this young man inherits the experience, tactics, and prowess in war of the great Sengoku strategist Nobunaga, though, his very destiny will change. <em class=de-emphasized>(from manga)</em>",
